      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has a lot more potential than many realize, especially given that the contact has a local to world matrix for shader authors to utilize. This indirectly fulfills one of my most wanted requests with regards to the shader aspects https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/components-that-take-transform-values-and-output-them-to-custom-shader-propertie",
